1432
01:07:27.110 --> 01:07:29.270
If you go and watch, Jenna, you'll see.

1433
01:07:29.470 --> 01:07:29.890
Okay.

1434
01:07:29.890 --> 01:07:31.250
There's a huge shadow.

1435
01:07:31.530 --> 01:07:32.930
