1436
01:07:32.930 --> 01:07:37.570
We needed to match that shadow exactly the second day we filmed.

1437
01:07:38.070 --> 01:07:38.470
Yeah.

1438
01:07:38.970 --> 01:07:39.270
Right?

1439
01:07:39.490 --> 01:07:43.270
So in order to do that, they had to create this fake shadow.

1440
01:07:43.490 --> 01:07:44.730
We have fakie shadow.

1441
01:07:45.030 --> 01:07:46.030
Fakie shadow.

1442
01:07:46.370 --> 01:07:47.130
Fakie shadow.

1443
01:07:47.370 --> 01:07:54.070
They used giant 20 by 20 bounce cards and positioned them behind the hedges on the street

1444
01:07:54.070 --> 01:07:58.570
so that the shadow would cast and match each day we filmed in the parking lot.

1445
01:07:58.570 --> 01:08:00.970
Gosh, those are things you just don't think about.

1446
01:08:01.290 --> 01:08:05.670
I know, but this is the amazing thing about your crew.

1447
01:08:05.870 --> 01:08:08.010
Someone was like, oh, hold up.

1448
01:08:08.130 --> 01:08:09.230
That shadow's not going to match.

1449
01:08:09.350 --> 01:08:10.590
We've got to recreate a shadow.

1450
01:08:10.950 --> 01:08:11.470
Amazing.

1451
01:08:12.090 --> 01:08:15.510
Well, fakie shadow wasn't the only fakie thing we had in the scene.

1452
01:08:15.510 --> 01:08:17.970
We also had fakie bicycle chain.

1453
01:08:18.250 --> 01:08:19.650
Fakie bicycle chain.

1454
01:08:19.890 --> 01:08:20.590
That's right.

1455
01:08:20.770 --> 01:08:24.030
Clearly, Rain could not whip around a real bicycle chain.

1456
01:08:24.470 --> 01:08:31.170
