01:09:11.090 --> 01:09:11.830
So good.

1472
01:09:12.130 --> 01:09:15.730
Dean told me that they came up with that idea on the day.

1473
01:09:15.930 --> 01:09:17.950
He said that as he and Jen Salata

1474
01:09:17.950 --> 01:09:24.250
